  "contentHtml": "<p>2020.9.22 ~9.23</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">스마트폰을 현미경으로 활용한 사례를 나눈&#160;</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">카톡 오픈채팅방(오채방) 이야기를 정리했습니다.</span></b></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 410px;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 212px;\"><td style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 212px;\" rowspan=\"2\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9f21544f62f5badb56fc2b01a3151ccf7378dfd\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"216\" height=\"246\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c9f21544f62f5badb56fc2b01a3151ccf7378dfd\" data-orgin-width=\"469\" data-origin-height=\"534\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 212px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc89ab1c96df95717ef1588eba61fbd871006a6b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fc89ab1c96df95717ef1588eba61fbd871006a6b\" data-orgin-width=\"395\" data-origin-height=\"268\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 212px;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f051e0191b0cf662a720b2bdebe119089c900cf\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8f051e0191b0cf662a720b2bdebe119089c900cf\" data-orgin-width=\"405\" data-origin-height=\"374\"></div></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 198px;\"><td style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 198px;\">들깨잎 뒷면의 기공이라는 답을 해주셨습니다.<br><br>출처 : 김규환의 작지만 큰세상<br><br>https://m.blog.naver.com/PostView.nhn?blogId=kyuhwan21&amp;logNo=221333068417&amp;referrerCode=0&amp;searchKeyword=%EA%B9%BB%EC%9E%8E</td><td style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 198px;\">https://m.blog.naver.com/PostView.nhn?blogId=lsb924&amp;logNo=80099645725&amp;proxyReferer=https:%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2F<br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>이번에는&#160;</b></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b>종이현미경, 간이현미경, 루페형 현미경에 대한 정보를 나누었습니다.</b></span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 266px;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 90px;\"><td style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 90px;\" rowspan=\"2\"><b>종이현미경으로 보려고 하는데&#160; 아이들이 집에서 만든 후 쉽게 볼만한 대상이 있을까요?<br><br></b><br>저도 이제야 구입해서 연습중이라서요 우선 저는 빛의 삼원색(컴퓨터 모니터에서 색을 칠하고 나뉘는거. 비상교과서에 있더라구요) 해봤구요 거실 바닥에 상처입은거 크게 보는 정도 관찰했습니다.&#160;<br><br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7bffffd0124abd576da303db391c5e046bf2f397\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7bffffd0124abd576da303db391c5e046bf2f397\" data-orgin-width=\"450\" data-origin-height=\"626\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 230px;\" rowspan=\"2\"><b>지마켓?? 같은데서&#160;<br>종이현미경, 간이현미경 이라고 <br>치면 두가지가 나와요&#160;<br>foldscope - 적정기술 말라리아 보려고 만든 현미경이구여&#160;&#160;<br>실제모양비슷한 종이현미경은 40배율이라고 해서 Foldscope&#160;로&#160;사랴고&#160;합니다<br><br><br>종이 현미경 구입처 :</b><br><br><a href=\"https://smartstore.naver.com/excoa/products/4929262563\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">smartstore.naver.com/excoa/products/4929262563</a><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/774c494bc7912b054425891f606368c3ff9ebb21\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/774c494bc7912b054425891f606368c3ff9ebb21\" data-orgin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div>종이로 만드는 폴드스코프는&#160;<br>유튜브에 영상도 많습니다.<br><br>집에서&#160;옷&#160;섬유나&#160;종이&#160;머리카락&#160;이런거&#160;관찰해보라&#160;했습니다.<br><a href=\"http://me2.do/FTnpZXzm\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">me2.do/FTnpZXzm</a><br><br><br>과학상자 6,720원</td><td style=\"width: 33.33%; height: 90px;\" rowspan=\"2\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/291aa22ded450612b462000c60b0324df1783b22\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"182\" height=\"543\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/291aa22ded450612b462000c60b0324df1783b22\" data-orgin-width=\"322\" data-origin-height=\"960\"></div>이런&#160;스마트폰 현미경도 있습니다.<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/PostView.nhn?blogId=lsb924&amp;logNo=80099645725&amp;proxyReferer=https:%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2F\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/PostView.nhn?blogId=lsb924&amp;logNo=80099645725&amp;proxyReferer=https:%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2F</a>&#160;<br><br><br><br><br></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\"><b><br>스마트폰으로 찍은 사진을 전시하였습니다.</b></span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 33.33%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0d7b06a1e383b913d4b8e21f9a9ca4935e6b8195\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0d7b06a1e383b913d4b8e21f9a9ca4935e6b8195\" data-orgin-width=\"399\" data-origin-height=\"312\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.33%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f2f05044ff05ce6ce68138c94684ca715b49e1f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f2f05044ff05ce6ce68138c94684ca715b49e1f\" data-orgin-width=\"5664\" data-origin-height=\"4248\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 33.33%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a9cc14e7dd3b6c657d81096e1640425a8c0f3c6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a9cc14e7dd3b6c657d81096e1640425a8c0f3c6\" data-orgin-width=\"5664\" data-origin-height=\"4248\"></div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 33.33%;\">선생님 저도 해보고 싶네요 사진 수합 방법과 검은 종이, 글씨 인쇄 어떻게 저리 깔끔하게 하셨는지 궁금해요^^<br><br>학생들이&#160;찍은&#160;사진은&#160;파일로&#160;일일이&#160;받았어요.&#160;요즘&#160;같은&#160;때라면&#160;구글드라이브로&#160;공유받거나&#160;네이버폼으로&#160;받아도&#160;되고..&#160;패들렛에&#160;올려도&#160;괜찮을것&#160;같아요^^&#160;<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></td><td style=\"width: 33.33%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/63a5d7f334a8f6d88d12375610cd3338ed07d2cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/63a5d7f334a8f6d88d12375610cd3338ed07d2cb\" data-orgin-width=\"505\" data-origin-height=\"368\"></div>저는&#160;이런식으로&#160;학생들에게&#160;받은&#160;파일을&#160;정리해서&#160;인화&#160;맡겼습니다^^&#160;도움이&#160;되셨으면&#160;좋겠어요~~&#160;<br>저는&#160;항상&#160;재과만에서&#160;엄청&#160;도움을&#160;받아요.&#160;모두&#160;감사합니다!</td><td style=\"width: 33.33%;\">저희는&#160;교내대회로&#160;할때&#160;스마트폰&#160;거치대를&#160;쓰고.&#160;포켓포토프린터로&#160;바로&#160;출력해주고.&#160;사진을&#160;붙여서&#160;글을&#160;쓰게&#160;합니다.&#160;포켓포토프린터도&#160;같이&#160;활용하시면&#160;좋아요.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\"><br><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35b9b5cd7543a19c16681d85c1fcdde8c80239d8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/35b9b5cd7543a19c16681d85c1fcdde8c80239d8\" data-orgin-width=\"307\" data-origin-height=\"266\"></div>이 제품이 사용 만족도가 높은데요.<br>제가 구입했던 업체 소개합니다.<br>풍산기업사 032-556-6400<br><br>&#39;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&#39; 교사회원이라고 하면 <br>8만원에 해주실 겁니다~<br><br>제가 영업사원도 아니고^^<br>정보 공유합니다~</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100.2%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 100%;\"><b>&#160;&#39;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&#39;에</b><b>&#160;수업에 대해&#160;보고, 듣고,&#160;느끼고, 생각하고,&#160;상상하는 모든 것들을</b><b>&#160;<br>매일매일 나도 채우고, 당신도 채우고, 우리도 함께&#160;채우고 있습니다.</b><b>&#160;<br>그것들이 쌓여있다가 내가 필요한 순간, 당신이&#160;필요한 순간에&#160;튀어나옵니다.<br></b><b><br></b><b>&#160;&#39;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&#39;는</b><b> &#39;우리가 함께 만드는 뽑기 상자&#39; 입니다!</b>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&#160;<br>&#160;<a href=\"http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IWN/125\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IWN/125</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
